# Vendored Slang compiler library (loaded dynamically by shaderc; see 3rdparty/slang).
# Must match the SLANG_VERSION_NUMERIC of the vendored headers. On Windows the SPIR-V/DXIL
# paths do not need the fork's Metal-native patches, so a stock Slang release dll suffices;
# the fork's own Windows build is the long-term source. (RT_WINDOWS_ROADMAP.md M0.)
!slang.dll
